<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 20-25.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 20-25.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for June</p>
<p>20-25. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	   June 20-25	June 19/20</p>
<p> CZK	0.43133	   0.4309</p>
<p> DKK	2.10016	   2.1011</p>
<p> FIM	2.67113	   2.6723</p>
<p> HUF	0.0745	    0.07457</p>
<p> JPY	0.12059	   0.12225</p>
<p> LTL	3.45307	   3.46173</p>
<p> LVL     24.20324	  24.26641</p>
<p> RUR	0.0024	    0.0024</p>
<p> SEK	1.7883	    1.79104</p>
<p> UAH	7.43688	   7.47117</p>
<p> USD     13.814	    13.8452</p>
<p> XEU     15.65472	  15.65338</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
